_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOEhPl1yQLcWj8tuGZnL9Vj-XJkIT2WM4YZwAmsMeo-zA&oe=6AC107E6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "3446365605583986", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_3446365608917319_4837108019305750600_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QJK51zaAwVgQ7kNvwFMV4cg&_nc_oc=AdqK-HZucclcOVy1eV0oRvMh_6LpgSfxLO3y1CJzjECeJLnDTB_nh389jhcn7OCU3ss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOf_M_YQdDibxPx2egCXa56g6ijAn7xeDDJKa3L0SKrpg&oe=6AC1068F"}, "display_name": "Reality Ruler", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the power of spatial understanding with Reality Ruler: 3D Measurement in MR! Our app utilizes the device's pass-through mode to turn your environment into a digital workspace for measurement.\n\nFeatures:\n\nMeasure Line Lengths: Draw lines in real space and get their lengths instantly.\nArea Calculations: Evaluate the area of polygons, rectangles, and circles with simple gestures.\nAngles: Get precise angles between intersecting lines in 3D space.\nVolumetrics: Estimate the volume of 3D shapes like cuboids, cylinders, cones, and spheres.\nReality Ruler offers an intuitive interface and simple controls, making it easy for anyone to get started. Whether you're a student learning geometry, a carpenter planning a project, or simply someone who wants to better understand the space around them, Reality Ruler provides an accurate and interactive way to measure the world.\n\nTurn your Headset into a powerful measurement tool with Reality Ruler: 3D Measurement in MR.", "short_description": "Measure real-world objects in 3D using your Headset's pass-through mode. Calculate length, area, angles, and volume effortlessly with Reality Ruler."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.visionxr.co.in/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publi